        <p>NO BETTER PRESENT to make a friend on active service at home or abroad than a bottle of this famous Medicine. Of all chemists: 1/3, 3/-, 5/-.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-01-22_WidnesExaminer_art0018" n="art0018">
        <head>ALWAYS ASK FOR A</head>
