        <head>RAINCOATS</head>
        <p>RAINCOATS</p>
        <p>READY FOR WEAR, in the Latest Shades and the Ncw Style. i Both Ladies and Gents' are Reduced in Price, and include the New Shades of Brown.)</p>
      </div>
