      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-01-22_WidnesExaminer_art0094" n="art0094">
        <head>ADVERTISE!</head>
        <p>ADVERTISE!</p>
        <p>"The Examiner" Will Find You</p>
        <p>Customers, Tenants, or Audiences.</p>
        <p>The Warrington Examiner," being one oi the best read pipers in the provinces, is always an admirable vehicle by which to convey messages between sonar and buyer, employer and employed, landlord and tenant, entertainer and entertained; in fact between all who wish to do business of any kind.</p>
        <p>"Xlie Warrington Examiner" is now read every week by thousands of readers more than ever before, is stirring war stories written by local men at the _front and its excellent portraits of local men who have fallen, been wounded or won honours, having resulted in a substantially increased circulation.</p>
        <p>It follows that "The Warrington Evaminer " is rache valuable and becomes increasingly more valuable to advertisers. Advertising is its own reward if done judiciously, scientifi- cally and in the right class of newspaper. We supply the right newspaper, and our staff are at the disposal of customers to give advica and assistance wtarerer :chaired.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-01-22_WidnesExaminer_art0095" n="art0095">
