      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-01-22_WidnesExaminer_art0292" n="art0292">
        <head>Medical.</head>
        <p>Medical.</p>
        <p>LAYETTES.—Parcel Baby Long Clothes, also few Shortening Clothes, good.-20, Salisbury- avenue, Southend. MOLESKIIS.-25/- per 100 paid for best quality till April.—Gerrard Bros., Furriers, Edinburgh.</p>
        <p>NO More Broken Glass.—Glazine Unbreakable Glass Substitute. Lifetime's wear; strong, durable, clear, transparent. 'Sheets cut to order, 1/- square foot. 1,000 testimonials.—Glazine Manu- factory, Wadsley-lane, Sheffield.</p>
        <p>SOME Bargains.—Sheffield Safety Razors in box with Blade, VG. Every Razor guaranteed. —G. Bamford, 155, Lion-street, Walworth, Lon- don, S.E.</p>
      </div>
