        <p>103 YEARS OLD. Sister Of Men Who Fought At Waterloo. Miss Ruth Roberts, of Folkestone, was 103 years old on Sunday. She was born at Hythe, one of a family of twenty-two. Her father and two of her brothers fought at Waterloo. Miss Roberts is in exe,ellent health and spirits, and received many callers and presents on Saturday.</p>
